- Fix ③ (MessageContent.vue): rimCached line-level render cache — finalized lines hit the cache (same string → same v-html prop → DOM not rebuilt), only the growing last line recomputed per frame; 3000-line cap with auto cleanup
- Verification: verify_render_perf.mjs 32/32 (throttle 60s simulation 501 flushes; isFrozen real-source extraction 10 scenarios; rimCached real-source extraction 5 scenarios) + vue-tsc; temp measurement files cleaned
