2026-08-13: Agent paging translateX bug fix (root cause of chat_agent being invisible)
- Root cause: ModelConfigPanel.vue paging used translateX(-${agentPage*50}%) — 50% is relative to the row's own width (= container width W), but each page's content width = W (chip flex-basis 50%), so paging should move W but moved only W/2 → page 2 misaligned: with 3 agents barely visible (half-page shift), with 4 agents the 4th chip starts at W+6, fully out of viewport → chat_agent invisible
- Fix: 50% → 100% (translateX(-${agentPage*100}%))
- Ruled out during investigation: dist contains chat_agent ✓, app.exe references the new hash ✓, PyInstaller includes chat_agent.yaml ✓, WebView2 cache (cleared, no effect) → the real bug was the paging CSS
